note('2487','hi','Aisha reports that three decisions arose concerning Barirah, but this own field supplies only the charity/gift matter and the actual eat-without-hesitation reply. Preserve the announced three without inventing the other two. The father-name genealogy parenthesis in the route is an identity explanation; keep it as context.')
